<header class="hero wrap" style="max-width:none">
  <div class="hl">
    <div class="lbl">Open-source · Kotlin · Android · v26.x</div>
    <h1>Linux<br>in your<br><span>pocket</span><i>.</i></h1>
    <div>
      <p class="sub" style="margin-bottom:28px">Rootless Debian and Ubuntu on Android through proot. Multiple terminals, apt, and a mobile-tuned Code Server. No account, no telemetry, no tracking.</p>
      <div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="https://github.com/abrahdev/ProotCode/releases">Get the APK ↓</a><a class="btn alt" href="https://abrahdev.github.io/ProotCode/">Read the docs →</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hr">
    <svg class="big" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.16)"><use href="#gl"/></svg>
